flowchart TB
  accTitle: A blocked loop can consume little parent CPU
  accDescr: During spawnSync the parent loop cannot dispatch callbacks and stays outside its event provider. ELU can be near 1 while the parent mostly waits for the separate child, consuming little parent CPU.
