child waits on a timer"] --> B["Parent loop blocked
no callback dispatch"]
  B --> E["Outside event provider
ELU can approach 1"]
  S --> W["Parent mostly waits
child has separate CPU account"]
  W --> C["Parent process CPU
can remain low"]
